      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.46 (vs ₹1.33 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.46 (up from ₹1.33 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹743.9m (up 37% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹45.2m (up 149% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.1% (up from 3.3% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
